{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Great Places to Visit", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Trip, Trail, True", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 4, "type": "position"}, {"content": "scholar > Wining and Dining > Rice: The Staff of Life", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 15, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Describe routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Stressing New Information", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you want to stress new information, you use different intonation and stress on the \u201cnew\u201d word or idea.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You usually stress content words in a sentence. Content words are the words that carry the most meaning (nouns, verbs, adjectives, adverbs etc.). <br>When you want to introduce new information in a conversation, you can choose to put the stress and the intonation on the \u201cnew\u201d words. This helps the listener understand that you want to stress that word and that it is important.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Look at this simple conversation:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Tom: I <span class=\"strong\">need</span> a <span class=\"strong\">pair</span> of <span class=\"strong\">shoes</span>.<br> Jason: What <span class=\"strong\">kind</span> of shoes? (\u201ckind\u201d is the new information, \u201cshoes\u201d is the old)<br> Tom: <span class=\"strong\">Dress</span> shoes.<br> Jason: Any <span class=\"strong\">color</span> of dress shoes?<br> Tom: <span class=\"strong\">Black</span> dress shoes.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you stress these \u201cnew\u201d words, your voice will rise slightly (intonation). ", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Talking About What Is Advisable", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the modal <span class=\"italic\">ought to</span> and <span class=\"italic\">might want to</span> to give advice. You can also use <span class=\"italic\">had better</span> to express a recommendation. You can use the contraction <span class=\"italic\">'d</span> better when you speak.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">Ought to</span> to offer strong advice.<br> Example: <span class=\"italic\">You ought to</span> pack warm clothes = You have to pack warm clothes.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">Might want to</span> to make a suggestion.<br> Example: <span class=\"italic\">You might want to</span> pack warm clothes = I suggest that you pack warm clothes.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can use <span class=\"italic\">Had better</span> to give a strong recommendation.<br> Example: <span class=\"italic\">You had better</span> save your money = I strongly recommend you save your money.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You'd better start training! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You ought to find a tranquil place to relax.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You might want to save your money.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "tranquil", "type": "name"}, {"content": "calm; peaceful", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: I'm trying to find a tranquil place to spend my vacation.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le15ob04aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about travel.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "tricky ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "difficult ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Traveling around Mexico was tricky.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le15ob04aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to get around ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to travel within a place ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Getting around Mexico is hard.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le15ob04aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "trail ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a beaten path through a forest or along a mountain ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  I think I might go hiking on a trail somewhere \u2026", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le15ob04aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to come along ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to join someone on a trip ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You should come along. It'll be fun!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le15ob04aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to keep up ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to stay at the same pace or speed as someone else", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You'd better start training ... you need to keep up! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le15ob04aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn6le15ob04re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Imagine you and a friend are going on a trip.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a dialogue (6-8 lines) between you and your friend.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Talk about what is advisable.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice the dialogue with your partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I write a dialogue about travel.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about what is advisable.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "My partner and I practice the dialogue.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn6le15ob04re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn6le15ob04re2img06.jpg", "id": 0, "time": "0", "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn6le15ob04re2img06.jpg", "id": 1, "time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: So, Sal, are you planning on traveling anytime soon? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Well, I've caught the travel bug, so I've been thinking about where to go next. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well, you'd better think of somewhere soon before I plan your trip for you! I need a vacation ..."}, {"image": "engenn6le15ob04re2img02.jpg", "id": 2, "time": "13500", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: <span class=\"italic\">Another</span> vacation? You just went to Mexico. You might want to save your money ...<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I <span class=\"italic\">have</span> saved some money. My job at the restaurant pays well. I'm trying to find a more tranquil place to spend my holidays. Mexico was great, but there was too much traffic. It was really tricky getting around there. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I think I might go hiking on a trail somewhere ..."}, {"image": "engenn6le15ob04re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "time": "35500", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: What <span class=\"italic\">kind</span> of trail?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: A really <span class=\"italic\">long</span> trail - a true adventure!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'll come along to keep you out of trouble! You don't want to hurt yourself!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Weren't you the one that hurt yourself at the Grand Canyon?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yeah, but I've trained a lot with Marco ... I'm in great shape! You ought to start training ... you need to keep up!"}], "coverimg": "engenn6le15ob04re2img06.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "id": 1}, {"title": "", "contents": [{"value": "engenn6le15ob04